<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., school bonds won by J.P. Morgan.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., school bonds won by J.P. Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said Tuesday it won $140 million School District of Dade County, Fla., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.183 percent.</p>
